<title>UK: Hambros replaces finance director.</title>
<headline>Hambros replaces finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>British banking group Hambros Plc said on Friday it had appointed Simon Leathes as its group finance director, replacing C.B. Tilley, who will be retiring from the board and its associate companies Hambros Bank Ltd and Hambro Countrywide Plc.  </p>
<p>In a statement Hambros said that Leathes would take up his new posts from January 2, 1997.</p>
<p>Tilley will continue as a non-executive director of associate company Hambro Insurance Services Group Plc, but will retire from the boards of the other main Hambro companies.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
